{"id":"msg_m_ex_littlecannon_05","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_littlecannon","label":"The Carronades · Group"},"label":"5. I've decided.","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_littlecannon_04","next":null,"speakers":{"belorta":"Belorta","mica":"Mica"},"icons":{"belorta":"si_c060_00_s","mica":"si_c061_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"belorta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_1","text":"I've decided.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_2","text":"Huh?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_3","text":"Decided what?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"belorta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_4","text":"There's something I want to try out.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"belorta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_5","text":"I need your help, Old-Timer.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_6","text":"Oh, this sounds like fun!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_7","text":"I wanna chip in too!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"belorta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_8","text":"Really?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"belorta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_9","text":"You don't even know what it is.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_10","text":"If you're involved, I'm sure it'll be a blast.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"belorta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_11","text":"Hehe, really?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"belorta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_12","text":"No take-backs!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_13","text":"Cross my heart.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_14","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_14","text":"What are you planning on doing?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"belorta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_15","text":"I...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"belorta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_16","text":"am going to film a mukbang!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_17","text":"Muk-what?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_18","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_18","text":"I should have known it'd have to do with eating.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"belorta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_19","text":"Naturally!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"belorta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_20","text":"Mukbangs are all the rage right now.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"belorta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_21","text":"And as we all know, I can pile away food with the best of 'em.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"belorta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_22","text":"If I go viral, I could make a small fortune off this.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_23","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_23","text":"Where do I come into all this?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"belorta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_24","text":"The food, of course.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"belorta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_25","text":"You'll be preparing all sorts of scrumptious meals,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"belorta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_26","text":"and then Mica and I will go to town on them.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"belorta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_27","text":"10 servings for each of us, so 20 in total.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_28","text":"I can't eat that much.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"belorta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_29","text":"No take-backs,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"belorta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_30","text":"remember?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_31","text":":-'(","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_32","text":"I'll try my best.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"belorta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_33","text":"That's the spirit!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"belorta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_34","text":"I'll touch base with you once I've booked a studio.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_35","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_35","text":"I never agreed to help...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"belorta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_36","text":"Let's go and practice eating, Mica.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"mica","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_37","text":"All right!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_littlecannon_05_38","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_littlecannon_05_38","text":"... It may be time to dig into my savings account.","jump":null}],"chat":true}